  "hint": "Each edge turns into four edges, so count the new triangles as well as their size.",
  "steps": [
    "Round 1: 3 triangles of 1/9 each add 1/3.",
    "Each round has 4 times as many triangles at 1/9 the size, so it adds 4/9 of the last round.",
    "Total added: 1/3 × 1 / (1 − 4/9) = 1/3 × 9/5 = 3/5.",
    "Final area: 1 + 3/5 = 1.6."
